ldapbrowser is an LDAP browser bash application version 1.0.0

Usage: ldapbrowser <command>

Commands:
	version			Show ldapbrowser version information
	describe		Show ldapbrowser description information
	setup			Set up and define the required ldapbrowser settings
	debug			Set on/off debug log (useful for network and application issues debug, LDAP queries detailed content and others)
	themes			Set up current ldapbrowser colour theme
	list			List an LDAP directory tree starting from the defined branch
	help			Show this help message

Examples:
	ldapbrowser version
	ldapbrowser describe
	ldapbrowser help
	ldapbrowser
	ldapbrowser setup
	ldapbrowser debug on
	ldapbrowser debug off
	ldapbrowser themes
	ldapbrowser list
